<div id="S3.SS2.SSS5.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS2.SSS5.p3.1" class="ltx_p">For a detailed list of heuristics, please refer to
Appendix <a href="#A1" title="Appendix A Arid Node Heuristics ‣ Practical Mutation Testing at Scale A view from Google" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A</span></a>.</p>
