<section id="A1.SS1.SSS4" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection"><span id="A1.SS1.SSS4.6" class="ltx_text">A-A</span>4 </span>Time Related Code</h4>

<div id="A1.SS1.SSS4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Clocks are usually faked in tests, and networking
calls are short-circuited to special RPC implementations for testing; it therefore rarely makes sense to mutate time expressions when used in a deadline-context, because they would lead to unproductive mutants.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.SS1.SSS4.fig1" class="ltx_figure">
<div id="A1.SS1.SSS4.fig1.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_language_go ltx_lstlisting ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64,LSAgfDo6U2xlZXBGb3IoYWJzbDo6U2Vjb25kcyg1KSk7fA==" download="">⬇</a></div>
