<section id="A1.SS1.SSS5" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection"><span id="A1.SS1.SSS5.6" class="ltx_text">A-A</span>5 </span>Tracing and Debugging</h4>

<div id="A1.SS1.SSS5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Code is often adorned with debugging and
tracing information that may be even excluded in the release builds, but present
while testing. This code serves its purpose, but is usually impossible to test
and mutants in that code do not make good test goals.</p>
</div>
