<div id="A1.SS1.SSS6.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS6.p2.1" class="ltx_p">In this example, developers usually test the components of the pipeline, but not the code assembling the pipeline. Similar examples exist for TensorFlow:</p>
</div>
