<p id="A1.SS1.SSS10.p2.1" class="ltx_p">In an expression of format <span id="A1.SS1.SSS10.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">x != nullptr</span>, mutating it to <span id="A1.SS1.SSS10.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">x</span> is
