</div>
</div></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:100%;height:1px;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<div id="A1.SS1.SSS16.fig2.2" class="ltx_listing ltx_figure_panel ltx_lst_language_java ltx_lstlisting ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64,cHJpdmF0ZSBzdGF0aWMgZmluYWwgRG91YmxlIG5leHRHZW5UcmFmZmljUmF0aW8gPSBIMC4xICsgMUg7" download="">⬇</a></div>
