</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.SSS19.p7" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS19.p7.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.SSS19.p7.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Soundness.</span> This heuristic is sound because it has the full type and
expression information available.</p>
</div>
