<section id="A1.SS1.SSS20" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection"><span id="A1.SS1.SSS20.6" class="ltx_text">A-A</span>20 </span>Collection Size</h4>

<div id="A1.SS1.SSS20.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS20.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The size of a collection cannot be a negative number, so when comparing the length of a container to zero, some mutants resulting from the comparison may produce unreachable code and make for unproductive test goals.</p>
</div>
